                                                "sense_id": "463f66c5-611d-37f2-87f9-2c8c9a9fc66d",
                                                "text": "When the pub downstairs closed, a contingent of straight couples ranging in age from 16 to 60 arrived to dance, though they were still safely outnumbered by same-sex huggers and smoochers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6d1759f-dce9-44f7-bcc6-2a74ce93d104",
                                                "sense_id": "463f66c5-611d-37f2-87f9-2c8c9a9fc66d",
                                                "text": "Jenny hadn’t been a natural hugger, but she’d been a smiler, a handholder."
